| 1 | `addAndDoNothing` | Assertion-Free | Trivial | Silent false-pass — highest risk |
| 2 | `addNullSkuManualCatch` | Exception Handling | Low | Catches `Exception` — can hide wrong-type bugs |
| 3 | `addConditionalLogic` | Conditional Test Logic | Low | Hidden branches = hidden gaps |
| 4 | `addLoadsFromFile` | Mystery Guest | Low | Filesystem dependency = flaky CI |
| 5 | `addSleepy` | Sleepy Test | Trivial | Free 200 ms back, zero risk |
| 6 | `doEverythingAtOnce` | Eager Test | Medium | Split into focused tests |
| 7 | `quantityAfterAdds` | Magic Number | Low | Name the constants |
| 8 | `toStringFormat` | Sensitive Equality | Low | Use `contains` or test data directly |
| 9 | `setUp` / `rng` | General Fixture | Trivial | Delete unused field |
